00:51:35.030 --> 00:51:48.760
Let's begin.

00:51:48.760 --> 00:51:52.680
Why did you always hate my mother?

00:51:52.680 --> 00:51:54.730
- I didn't hate her.

00:51:54.730 --> 00:51:57.910
I hated her weakness and her immorality.

00:51:57.910 --> 00:51:59.390
- I often go to the cliff.

00:51:59.390 --> 00:52:00.000
I'm thinking of...

00:52:00.350 --> 00:52:08.210
Planting some pine trees and there isn't a single tree there and she was so fond of them. What do you think a very touching idea?

00:52:08.530 --> 00:52:22.990
John Maria is going to get married soon. Please leave her alone

00:52:23.210 --> 00:52:30.000
That still leaves Teresa and Esther for you leave your cousins alone

00:52:30.060 --> 00:52:31.860
all three of them, please.

00:52:31.860 --> 00:52:37.290
- Remember your heart.

00:52:37.290 --> 00:52:40.660
You look tired, are you?

00:52:43.100 --> 00:52:46.090
Why don't you close your eyes

00:52:46.090 --> 00:52:49.340
and sleep like a good little girl?

00:52:49.340 --> 00:52:52.790
Would you like me to sing you a lullaby?

00:52:52.790 --> 00:52:56.360
- That would be nice.

00:52:56.360 --> 00:53:00.000
It would be so wonderful.

00:53:01.150 --> 00:53:04.480
- Why do you behave so strangely sometimes?

00:53:04.480 --> 00:53:07.650
- I'm irresponsible.

00:53:07.650 --> 00:53:11.170
Didn't the doctor tell you a real minister society?

00:53:11.170 --> 00:53:14.210
- It's not surprising.

00:53:14.210 --> 00:53:19.460
Brought up without a father and your mother.

00:53:19.460 --> 00:53:25.250
May she rest in peace.

00:53:25.250 --> 00:53:26.930
- She had her punishment.

00:53:26.930 --> 00:53:28.540
She killed herself.

00:53:28.540 --> 00:53:30.000
She cannot rest in peace.

00:53:32.200 --> 00:53:33.490
It was an accident.

00:56:28.540 --> 00:56:29.250
What's the matter?

00:56:32.720 --> 00:56:36.210
This man is a strange animal. He has a conscience.

00:56:36.210 --> 00:56:38.930
You're so different now.

00:56:38.930 --> 00:56:42.910
Dr. Quinquiro would change anyone.

00:56:42.910 --> 00:56:47.960
He destroys you slowly, like a worm inside your brain.

00:56:47.960 --> 00:56:53.520
And finally you realize there's only dust in your head. Dust.

00:56:53.520 --> 00:56:59.640
Maria would do it better, wouldn't she?

00:57:00.060 --> 00:57:04.450
- You sound like a woman now. - Why didn't you marry her?

00:57:05.240 --> 00:57:11.980
I wanted to show her the Taj Mahal, the temples of Luxor, the China Wall,

00:57:12.220 --> 00:57:14.050
but she didn't want to come with me.

00:57:15.640 --> 00:57:24.040
I would have. I'd like to go away with you.

00:57:32.040 --> 00:57:34.880
- You don't think I'm... - No.

00:57:34.880 --> 00:57:38.810
At least at first I wasn't.

00:57:38.810 --> 00:57:42.570
But now perhaps I am.

00:57:42.570 --> 00:57:44.830
I'd like to know.

00:57:44.830 --> 00:57:48.920
- Are you all right? - No, I'm not.

00:58:04.190 --> 00:58:05.810
Is this a new game?

00:58:09.450 --> 00:58:16.450
There's an innocent victim. In this case, you're it.

00:58:16.450 --> 00:58:25.380
- What are you doing? - I've got to do it.

00:58:25.380 --> 00:58:27.490
I've got to do it.

00:58:48.650 --> 00:58:50.100
I hope nobody saw you come up.

00:58:51.160 --> 00:58:55.660
- Where did you leave Mother? - Dad, in the garden.

00:59:04.350 --> 00:59:07.460
- Are you happy? - I'm all right.

00:59:09.540 --> 00:59:11.270
You sure no one saw you come up?

00:59:43.880 --> 00:59:51.420
- What's wrong? - When did this war first begin?

00:59:54.810 --> 00:59:57.430
First, I was sure I could stand it.

01:00:01.080 --> 01:00:05.310
something began to go to pieces in my brain,

01:00:05.310 --> 01:00:11.570
and something else began to grow.

01:00:11.570 --> 01:00:13.930
Hatred!

01:00:13.930 --> 01:00:23.490
It was painful, but when I accepted it...

01:00:23.490 --> 01:00:25.660
- Why do you talk like that?

01:00:25.660 --> 01:00:26.560
Where's my mother?

01:00:33.450 --> 01:00:40.730
I told you, she's dead.

01:00:40.730 --> 01:00:44.440
If there's none of you here, there'll be no case.

01:00:44.440 --> 01:00:47.070
And you're not going to be anywhere.

01:00:47.070 --> 01:00:48.890
I'm irresponsible.

01:00:48.890 --> 01:00:50.880
That's what your doctors have said.

01:00:50.880 --> 01:00:53.610
I don't know the difference between right and wrong.

01:00:53.610 --> 01:00:54.980
And you know why.

01:00:54.980 --> 01:00:58.590
There is no difference.

01:00:58.590 --> 01:00:59.730
There are only rules.

01:01:30.860 --> 01:01:38.320
No, no, no, no.

01:02:00.410 --> 01:02:03.590
If you think you're scaring me, you're wasting your time.

01:02:03.590 --> 01:02:07.140
I know you're there.

01:02:07.140 --> 01:02:09.590
We were all free then.

01:02:09.590 --> 01:02:13.390
The past didn't exist, and the future wasn't a threat.

01:02:13.390 --> 01:02:16.290
We weren't trapped in the web.

01:02:16.290 --> 01:02:27.090
Trapped? How? Where's Mother?

01:02:27.090 --> 01:02:28.070
Asleep.

01:02:31.660 --> 01:02:43.450
- And your sisters, you and I are the only ones awake.

01:02:43.450 --> 01:02:51.310
- I want you to know one thing, I don't trust you.

01:02:51.310 --> 01:02:55.450
I know you're capable of anything.

01:02:55.450 --> 01:02:58.460
- Aunt Martha and you have made your plans,

01:02:58.460 --> 01:03:00.000
and I have made mine.

01:03:00.190 --> 01:03:02.790
I really believe you're sick.

01:03:06.090 --> 01:03:12.160
- I'm mad. - I can get you put away again.

01:03:13.020 --> 01:03:14.980
I'll even lie, if I have to.

01:03:16.310 --> 01:03:24.900
You already lied once, told them I tried to rape you.

01:03:33.130 --> 01:03:35.590
- Don't touch me, don't touch me!

01:03:35.590 --> 01:03:37.430
Let me go! - It's too late now!

01:03:37.430 --> 01:03:39.800
- It's too late for all of us!

01:08:06.040 --> 01:08:13.380
After death, what happens to the skin, to the eyes, to the soft, silky hair?

01:08:14.370 --> 01:08:16.720
Everything rots and disappears.

01:08:17.620 --> 01:08:23.770
Your bodies will turn into sap, and in spring, the sap will rise up the pine trunks.

01:08:26.300 --> 01:08:29.480
In a few years, I'll come back to the cliff.

01:08:30.120 --> 01:08:35.420
And I'll think, those leaves are perhaps Teresa's fingers,

01:08:35.420 --> 01:08:40.600
and those others are cheeks and her lips.

01:08:40.600 --> 01:08:43.980
You'll always be facing the sea,

01:08:43.980 --> 01:08:51.920
and the wind will caress you for centuries and centuries.

01:10:01.690 --> 01:10:03.230
- What did you tell my husband?

01:10:03.230 --> 01:10:05.260
What kind of a bet did you and I make?

01:10:05.260 --> 01:10:07.460
When?

01:10:07.460 --> 01:10:11.240
- I'm sorry, it was a joke.

01:10:11.240 --> 01:10:14.230
- You like to play jokes, don't you?

01:10:14.230 --> 01:10:17.970
- I love it.

01:10:17.970 --> 01:10:22.180
- And the thing about us, was that also a joke?

01:10:22.180 --> 01:10:25.770
- I would have loved to have done it,

01:10:25.770 --> 01:10:28.220
but not with you unconscious.

01:10:28.220 --> 01:10:28.930
Not that way.

01:11:03.160 --> 01:11:07.650
- I can't open it.

01:11:07.650 --> 01:11:10.300
- When he comes back, pretend you're trying to escape.

01:11:10.300 --> 01:11:11.180
I'll kill him myself.

01:11:11.180 --> 01:11:14.660
- I won't let you.

01:11:14.660 --> 01:11:16.470
- He's completely crazy.

01:11:16.470 --> 01:11:23.680
Can't you see, it's his life or ours.

01:11:23.680 --> 01:11:26.720
- I want out, I want out.

01:11:30.220 --> 01:11:31.810
- You idiot!

01:11:31.810 --> 01:11:34.690
- Tell him to come and see me tomorrow night,

01:11:34.690 --> 01:11:36.660
at 12 o'clock.

01:11:36.660 --> 01:11:41.370
I'll apologize to him, if that'll make you happy.

01:11:41.370 --> 01:11:43.480
Now please go.

01:11:43.480 --> 01:11:49.270
- You-- - You shouldn't be here.

01:11:49.270 --> 01:11:50.000
Please go.

01:15:05.150 --> 01:15:07.610
- We've installed a new church bell.

01:15:07.610 --> 01:15:10.750
It weighs two tons.

01:15:10.750 --> 01:15:11.900
- And?

01:15:11.900 --> 01:15:14.430
- It'll be rung for the first time tomorrow.

01:15:14.430 --> 01:15:19.710
To operate it requires a system of counterweights.

01:15:19.710 --> 01:15:23.830
And you, you'll be one of the counterweights.

01:15:23.830 --> 01:15:25.850
- What will you tell them?

01:15:25.850 --> 01:15:29.570
That I ran away, in the end?

01:15:30.190 --> 01:15:56.920
- I couldn't hurt you. - The first peal of the bell.

01:16:07.450 --> 01:16:09.580
I only want to know one thing.

01:16:09.580 --> 01:16:14.080
Was I really insane or was it Dr. Quinquero?

01:16:14.080 --> 01:16:17.840
I must know. Who was right?

01:16:17.840 --> 01:16:21.120
You? Are you right?

01:16:21.120 --> 01:16:29.160
A malignant tumor has to be cut out.

01:16:31.150 --> 01:16:37.920
I could not sleep as long as you were alive.

01:16:40.810 --> 01:16:43.810
You've won. You've always won.

01:16:48.450 --> 01:16:49.850
May you all sleep in peace.

01:16:50.490 --> 01:16:52.790
The last two bricks.

01:16:54.430 --> 01:16:55.990
Who are you?

01:16:56.590 --> 01:16:58.740
The one who gets the last laugh.

01:16:58.740 --> 01:17:00.000
I don't know.

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:02.860
that you think that's funny.

01:17:02.860 --> 01:17:08.020
- You, you may leave here, but I promise you,

01:17:08.020 --> 01:17:19.590
I'll have the last laugh.

01:17:19.590 --> 01:17:30.000
- We live evolutions, civil disturbance.

01:17:32.590 --> 01:17:43.120
and killing many lands of innocent men, women, children, forbays political ends.

01:17:43.120 --> 01:17:54.200
Yet, in our darkest hours, there can still be heard by those who choose to listen the

01:17:54.200 --> 01:17:58.210
voice of our maker.

01:17:58.210 --> 01:17:59.700
God speaks to us.

01:18:00.440 --> 01:18:09.950
every moment of the day and of the night and in these dark times we need to hear him more than ever.

01:18:09.950 --> 01:18:17.920
I thank all those who have made their contributions so that this church may have this new bill

01:18:17.920 --> 01:18:29.920
which will carry the voice of our Lord to more distant places which will command the attention of all those who do not wish.

01:18:30.480 --> 01:18:31.220
to listen.

01:21:07.800 --> 01:21:10.690
- Esther?

01:21:10.690 --> 01:21:12.990
- I'm leaving.

01:21:12.990 --> 01:21:16.290
I won't go into that house again.

01:21:16.290 --> 01:21:17.850
- Why not?

01:21:17.850 --> 01:21:22.160
- You killed him.

01:21:22.160 --> 01:21:28.990
- We did something terrible, but it was necessary.

01:21:28.990 --> 01:21:29.510
- Goodbye.

01:21:31.240 --> 01:21:44.920
Esther you are underage. I can force you to obey me if you do. I'll tell everything mother screen it to the whole world

01:21:48.920 --> 01:21:51.000
Exhausted let's go

01:22:43.470 --> 01:22:44.660
It's getting foggy again.

01:22:45.030 --> 01:22:49.720
- Are you going to see him? - Who?

01:22:49.830 --> 01:22:51.730
You know perfectly well who.

01:22:51.880 --> 01:22:54.070
He wants to give you an explanation.

01:22:55.690 --> 01:22:59.570
No, it won't be necessary. I think our neighbor has finally left us alone.

01:23:00.510 --> 01:23:05.410
- Why? - He's gone away, abroad.

01:23:06.820 --> 01:23:10.120
- He didn't tell me that. - I don't want his name mentioned again.

01:23:35.120 --> 01:23:36.400
Didn't you say he had gone away?

01:24:52.880 --> 01:24:53.490
Right in.

01:25:22.490 --> 01:25:23.270
Over here.

01:25:30.920 --> 01:25:32.120
No, here.

01:26:13.760 --> 01:26:14.500
This way.

01:26:43.530 --> 01:26:56.370
- Come on. - What do you want, what do you want from me?

01:27:25.720 --> 01:27:26.370
Put you.

01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:33.810
Answer me! Can't be here! You can't!

01:28:02.240 --> 01:28:05.210
- Your last laugh! - Your last laugh!

01:28:36.970 --> 01:28:46.480
It was your laugh, last laugh, last laugh, last...
